Modifications made in this fork:

  - Renamed "Pipa"/"pipa-*" to "Opskeep"/"opskeep-*" throughout skill names, frontmatter,
    descriptions, and cross-references.
  - Removed Pipa's brand assets: the logo mark image and sound-design audio cues that
    shipped with opskeep-huddle-beta (formerly pipa-huddle-beta). That skill needs its
    own replacement assets before its UI is complete.
  - Genericized infrastructure configuration that pointed at Pipa's own deployed
    services: opskeep-huddle-beta's Cloudflare Worker previously targeted Pipa's live
    zone (usepipa.com) with real session-pairing/timeout settings. Those values were
    replaced with placeholders (opskeep.example) — this skill will not function until
    it has its own deployed voice-relay backend under a domain/zone you actually control.
  - References to the original pipa-skills GitHub repository were repointed to this
    repository's URL.

Everything else in this repository (the website-facing marketing copy, mcp-server/,
the original nine skills this fork replaced, and all top-level docs) is original work,
